<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῡρί-α</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>authority, power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				837a5
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>possession, control</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.11A.
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμιείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.13.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐπαποστεῖλαι στρατηγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.15.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυρίαν ἔχειν περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.14.10
				</span></i>
			.—The form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυρεία</span></b>  is freq. found in Pap. and Inscrr. from <span class="entity">i
			B.C.</span>, as <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1123.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.95i6
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, and codd., as <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.11A.
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>Da.</u>
				4.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.26(7)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.52
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.440f
			</span></i>(v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				427.9
			</span></i>, and is required by metre in <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.606
			</span></i>: 
				contr.
			 from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυριεία</span></b> 
			(q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύριος</span> (q.v.).</div>
